* Chunk naming: remember a short code until it is entered.
Goal: Enter a one time code
. Goal: Receive code
.. Hear <482913>
. Goal: Open verification field
.. Look at <verification field>
.. Touch <verification field>
. Goal: Enter code
.. Recall <482913>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <482913>
.. Verify <482913> is displayed
. Goal: Submit code
.. Look at <submit button>
.. Touch <submit button>
.. Verify verification is complete
